          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "2428:14853",
          "text": "A parent or legal guardian manages the family account. Confirm that you are 18 years or older before continuing. Children use a child profile supervised by their parent or guardian.",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 130,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "Regular"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "2428:14854",
          "text": "2. Child’s age",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 26,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "SemiBold"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "2428:14855",
          "text": "A parent or guardian provides the child’s date of birth when adding a child profile. The app uses the resulting age band to present suitable learning content and avatar choices. Do not enter another child’s real information in this prototype.",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 156,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "Regular"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
