          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "SemiBold"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "2428:14857",
          "text": "The parent creates a profile using a nickname, date of birth, avatar, preferred language and learning level. The profile separates each child’s learning experience within the family account. Optional details should remain optional.",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 156,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "Regular"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
