          "text": "4. Child data and parent controls",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 26,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
            "style": "SemiBold"
          },
          "size": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "2428:14859",
          "text": "Child profile information and learning progress support lessons, age-appropriate content and progress tracking. Child-data-processing consent is requested separately in the next step. Agreeing to these Terms does not turn on Personalization/AI, Voice-feature or Marketing consent.",
          "width": 338,
          "height": 208,
          "font": {
            "family": "Poppins",
